    <comment>tree-sitter-hcl: build the grammars to WebAssembly modules as well, into a new noarch tree-sitter-hcl-wasm subpackage (/usr/share/tree-sitter/wasm) for web-tree-sitter consumers such as opencode's highlighter. Uses the %treesitter_wasm_* macros from tree-sitter sr#1378013; nothing else changes.
INTERDEPENDENT REQUESTS - please stage together with sr#1378013 (tree-sitter) and the other tree-sitter-&lt;lang&gt; -wasm requests.</comment>
